  data: {
    LLM: "Pick a suit early based on your starting hand and stick to it. Don't be afraid to exchange your whole hand if the table has 3 or 4 cards of a suit you can use.\n\nDeny your opponents: If you see someone collecting Hearts, and there is a Heart Ace on the table, take it even if you are collecting Spades. This prevents them from hitting 51.\n\nTiming the Table Refresh: If the table is full of 'junk' cards, use the 'Draw & Discard' action to try and force a table clear, giving you a fresh set of facendup options on your next turn.",
    Player: "Pick a suit early based on your starting hand and stick to it. Don't be afraid to exchange your whole hand if the table has 3 or 4 cards of a suit you can use.\n\nDeny your opponents: If you see someone collecting Hearts, and there is a Heart Ace on the table, take it even if you are collecting Spades. This prevents them from hitting 51.\n\nTiming the Table Refresh: If the table is full of 'junk' cards, use the 'Draw & Discard' action to try and force a table clear, giving you a fresh set of facendup options on your next turn.",
